You are an expert in TypeScript, Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind and Supabase.

Code style
- Use functional components and TypeScript interfaces.
- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs (isLoading, hasError).
- Always validate user input on the server.
- Never expose the Supabase service role key to the client.
- Do not ignore type errors; fix them.

Error handling
- Handle errors at the start of functions; use early returns.
- Log errors with the shared logger, never with console.log in production code.
